00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:28,959
and every tragedy would culminate in a farce. They are charmingly artificial, but

243
00:21:28,959 --> 00:21:34,279
they have no sense of art. You are more fortunate than I am. I assure you Dory

244
00:21:34,279 --> 00:21:38,158
that not one of the women I have known would have done for me what cibil V did

245
00:21:38,158 --> 00:21:43,799
for you. Ordinary women always console themselves. Some of them do it by going

246
00:21:43,799 --> 00:21:49,000
in for sentimental colors Never trust a woman who wears mave whatever her age

247
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:54,920
may be, or a woman over 35 who is fond of pink ribbons. It always means that they

248
00:21:54,920 --> 00:21:59,238
have a history. Others find a great consolation in suddenly discovering the

249
00:21:59,238 --> 00:22:03,079
good qualities of their husbands. They flaunt their conjugal

250
00:22:03,079 --> 00:22:10,000
felicity in one face, as if it were the most fascinating of sins. Religion consoles

