00:22:28,760 --> 00:22:34,600
consolations that women find in modern life. Indeed, I have not mentioned the most important

255
00:22:34,600 --> 00:22:40,959
one.” “What is that, Harry?” said the lad listlessly. “Oh, the obvious consolation.

256
00:22:40,959 --> 00:22:46,238
Taking someone else’s admirer when one loses one’s own. In good society that

257
00:22:46,238 --> 00:22:50,920
always whitewashes a woman. But really, Dorian, how different Cil van must have

258
00:22:50,920 --> 00:22:56,000
been from all the women one meets! There is something to me quite beautiful about her

259
00:22:56,000 --> 00:23:00,959
death I'm glad I'm living in a century when such wonders happen. They make one

260
00:23:00,959 --> 00:23:06,359
believe in the reality of the things we all play with, such romance, passion, and

261
00:23:06,359 --> 00:23:14,040
love.” “I was terribly cruel to her. You forget that I'm afraid that women appreciate

262
00:23:14,040 --> 00:23:19,359
cruelty, downright cruelty, more than anything else. They have wonderfully

263
00:23:19,359 --> 00:23:24,120
primitive instincts. We have emancipated them, but they remain slaves looking for

264
00:23:24,120 --> 00:23:28,680
their masters, all the same. They love being dominated I'm sure you were

