00:25:58,600 --> 00:26:04,120
extraordinary good looks, will not be able to do.” “But suppose, Harry, I became

294
00:26:04,120 --> 00:26:11,359
haggard, and old, and wrinkled? What then?” “Ah, then,” said Lord Henry, rising to

295
00:26:11,359 --> 00:26:18,318
