296
00:26:18,318 --> 00:26:24,959
are brought to you. No, you must keep your good looks. We live in an age that reads

297
00:26:24,959 --> 00:26:31,520
too much to be wise, and that thinks too much to be beautiful. We cannot spare you.

298
00:26:31,520 --> 00:26:36,000
And now you had better dress and drive down to the CL club. We are rather late,

299
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:39,600
as it is.” “I think I shall join you at the opera,

300
00:26:39,600 --> 00:26:41,920
Harry. I feel too tired to eat anything.

301
00:26:41,920 --> 00:26:48,079
What is the number of your sister’s box 27 I believe. It is on the grand tier.

302
00:26:48,079 --> 00:26:53,398
You will see her name on the door. But I'm sorry you won’t come and dine.” “I

303
00:26:53,398 --> 00:26:57,959
don’t feel up to it,” said Dorian listlessly. “But I'm awfully obliged to

304
00:26:57,959 --> 00:27:02,959
you for all that you have said to me. You are certainly my best friend. No one has

305
00:27:02,959 --> 00:27:08,079
ever understood me as you have.” “We are only at the beginning of our

306
00:27:08,079 --> 00:27:14,238
friendship, Dorian,” answered Lord Henry, shaking him by the hand goodbye I shall

307
00:27:14,238 --> 00:27:22,279
see you before 9:30 I hope. Remember Patty is singing.” As he closed the door behind him,

308
00:27:22,279 --> 00:27:26,959
Dorian Gray touched the bell, and in a few minutes Victor appeared with the

309
00:27:26,959 --> 00:27:33,600
lamps and drew the blinds down. He waited impatiently for him to go. The man seemed

310
00:27:33,600 --> 00:27:38,959
to take an interminable time over everything. As soon as he had left, he

311
00:27:38,959 --> 00:27:45,279
rushed to the screen and drew it back. No; there was no further change in the

312
00:27:45,279 --> 00:27:49,199
picture. It had received the news of cibil Vain's death before he had known

