00:28:04,079 --> 00:28:08,760
Or was it indifferent to results? Did it merely take cognizance of

317
00:28:08,760 --> 00:28:13,398
what passed within the soul? He wondered, and hoped that someday he would see the

318
00:28:13,398 --> 00:28:18,719
change taking place before his very eyes, shuddering as he hoped

319
00:28:18,719 --> 00:28:25,879
it. Poor cibil What a romance it had all been! She had often mimicked death on the

