00:30:53,680 --> 00:30:58,959
remaining always young, however fantastic that chance might be, or with what

349
00:30:58,959 --> 00:31:04,719
fateful consequences it might be fraught? Besides, was it really under his

350
00:31:04,719 --> 00:31:10,760
control? Had it indeed been prayer that had produced the substitution? Might there not be some

351
00:31:10,760 --> 00:31:15,639
curious scientific reason for it all? If thought could exercise its influence

352
00:31:15,639 --> 00:31:20,559
upon a living organism, might not thought exercise an influence upon dead and

