00:31:31,920 --> 00:31:37,398
to atom in secret love or strange affinity? But the reason was of no

356
00:31:37,398 --> 00:31:42,158
importance. He would never again tempt by a prayer any terrible

357
00:31:42,158 --> 00:31:48,158
power. If the picture was to alter, it was to alter. That was

358
00:31:48,158 --> 00:31:53,120
all. Why inquire too closely into it? For there would be a real pleasure in

