00:31:58,318 --> 00:32:03,318
places. This portrait would be to him the most magical of mirrors. As it had

361
00:32:03,318 --> 00:32:08,398
revealed to him his own body, so it would reveal to him his own soul. And when

362
00:32:08,398 --> 00:32:12,760
winter came upon it, he would still be standing where spring trembles on the

