00:32:24,199 --> 00:32:28,639
blossom of his loveliness would ever fade. Not one pulse of his life would

366
00:32:28,639 --> 00:32:34,639
ever weaken. Like the gods of the Greeks, he would be strong, and and fleet, and

367
00:32:34,639 --> 00:32:39,639
joyous. What did it matter what happened to the colored image on the canvas? He

