00:32:39,639 --> 00:32:44,600
would be safe. That was everything. He drew the screen back into

369
00:32:44,600 --> 00:32:49,959
its former place in front of the picture, smiling as he did so, and passed into his

370
00:32:49,959 --> 00:32:56,520
bedroom, where his valet was already waiting for him. An hour later he was at the opera,

371
00:32:56,520 --> 00:33:00,199
and Lord Henry was leaning over his

372
00:33:00,639 --> 00:33:01,000
